## 4. `inspect_chunks.py` identified the actual pipeline break

We inspected:

```text
kv_store_text_chunks.json
```

and found:

```text
Total chunks: 1
```

The table was completely absent.

This gave us an important distinction:

```text
inspect_chunks.py
    ↓
What actually entered LightRAG?

inspect_kg.py
    ↓
What did LightRAG turn into entities/relationships?
```

The original pipeline was therefore:

```text
MinerU table HTML         ✅
        ↓
RAG-Anything             ?
        ↓
LightRAG chunks          ❌ table missing
        ↓
KG                       ❌ table facts impossible to extract
```

This also proved that changing the KG extraction prompt at that point would have been useless: the LLM could not extract information it had never received.

