## 5. Document status exposed an inconsistency

`kv_store_doc_status.json` reported:

```text
status: processed
multimodal_processed: True
chunks_count: 1
```

Even though only the normal text chunk existed.

So RAG-Anything considered multimodal processing complete despite the missing table chunk.

This became one reason to isolate the table pipeline instead of repeatedly processing the full PDF.

