## 6. Isolated table ingestion test

We created:

```text
phase2_table_only_test.py
```

The test reused the already-correct table from:

```text
kv_store_parse_cache.json
```

through our own helper:

```python
load_table_from_cache()
```

Then passed it directly into the official RAG-Anything API:

```python
await rag.insert_content_list(...)
```

Important distinction:

```text
load_table_from_cache()
```

is only **our debugging helper**.

It is not a RAG-Anything API.

Its job is simply:

```text
parse cache
    ↓
find type == "table"
    ↓
return known-good table object
```

By contrast:

```python
rag.insert_content_list(...)
```

is the real RAG-Anything ingestion path for already parsed content.

