# 15. Exact cause of the missing relationships

We then inspected:

```text
kv_store_llm_response_cache.json
```

using:

```text
inspect_llm_cache.py
```

This revealed the most important finding of the session.

The first extraction result ended here:

```text
entity<|#|>Water Consumption<|#|>OperatingParameter<|#|>The EL 4
```

It was truncated in the middle of an entity. 

LightRAG then performed its second extraction/gleaning pass.

That response ended here:

```text
entity<|#|>Dimensions<|#|>OperatingParameter<|#|>The EL 4.
```

Again, mid-sentence. 

Neither response produced:

```text
relation<|#|>...
```

and neither produced:

```text
<|COMPLETE|>
```

LightRAG explicitly requires:

```text
all entities first
↓
all relationships second
↓
<|COMPLETE|>
```



Therefore:

```text
LLM response truncates during entities
             ↓
never reaches relation generation
             ↓
LightRAG receives 18 entities
             ↓
0 semantic relations
```

This is the current blocker.

